Z||000000||Jefrysuko||06-02-2001||01:53 PM||||ok this one is for the computer people out there.  I tried downloading PIP lastnight on my home computer and it wasn't pulling up the box which allows you to save the file to disk etc.  Instead it pulled up a web page with a small logo for quick-time and took about 5 minutes and then it said done in the lower left hand corner and the address read "http://www.fiero.nl/download/pip104.zip".  There was no way that I could find to save the file all I had was a web page with a little quick-time logo as I said.<P>I was able to download just now in the computer lab at my college so I don't need help with getting the file but would like any help with downloading from my computer.||||reg||1
